            "body": "phase 1: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41474 \n\nphase 2?:\n\n- `messagesopt+=target:cmd|msg|pager` ??\n- [for \"geometry\"](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41474#discussion_r3846761865): ?\n  ```\n  messagesopt+=msgheight:,pagerheight:,dialogheight:\n  \" or new 'pagerpopup', 'dialogpopup' options in the shape of 'previewpopup' ?\n  previewpopup=height:10,width:60,border:rounded\n  ```\n\n\n\n> three or four categories that can be routed (e.g., `messages = progress:box,output:pager`),\n\nwhat about id-based routing?\n\n> a value with a default akin to `cmd:0.5,dialog:0.5,msg:0.5,pager:1`\n\nfloat numbers are not supported as options values yet... maybe a percent would work (OTOH both would require custom parsing so maybe it doesn't matter):\n\n    cmd:50%,dialog:50%,msg:50%,pager:100%",
